<title>PHILIPPINES: Rizal Bank Jan-Mar net 280.83 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Rizal Bank Jan-Mar net 280.83 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rizal Commercial Banking Corp said on Wednesday it posted a net income of 280.83 million pesos.</p>
<p>It said in a statement net operating income reached 365.40 million pesos.</p>
<p>The bank did not give comparative figures.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8936, FAX 817-6267</p>
</text>
